join lex left
join mother center
join creator rightmost
lex: Mother! I see you.
The Mother doesn't notice her.
mother: Creator, you must do something! They are suffering.
creator: ...
lex: Mother! I am here. What can I do?
mother: Why do you sit selfishly and pay no mind to what you've made? Why do you keep making more?
creator: I made them, and I gave them bread. What shall I do? If I gave them cake, their tongues would never know bread.
lex: Bread? That's all? You think that's enough?
creator: He looks at Lex.
creator: I gave you each other. Suffer together.
mother: My Child! You must ease their burden. You can lighten their load.
